  "synthesis": {
    "description": "Staff or facilities announce a move and pass on packing and labeling instructions from the move packets, such as tagging chairs with wire tags. Individuals reply with timing preferences and how much they have to move, and coordinators ask facilities to move equipment such as flat screens on a set morning, chasing when the work has not happened.",
    "steps": [
      "Facilities or an assistant circulates the move date and packing and labeling instructions.",
      "Staff pack and label boxes, chairs and equipment.",
      "Staff reply with timing preferences and the size of their move.",
      "A coordinator asks facilities to move specific equipment at a set time.",
      "The coordinator follows up when the move has not been carried out."
    ],
    "approach": "A move checklist sent with the packet listing labeling, packing, equipment and timing items, with a facilities ticket per equipment move that carries a promised date and triggers a reminder when it passes.",
    "rationale": "The work is packing and labeling by individuals plus scheduling with facilities; a checklist keeps instructions in one place, and tracked requests replace manual chasing.",
    "artifact_type": "checklist"
  },
